      "statement": "SMTPConfig is an immutable configuration class constructed exclusively via static factory methods (forPlain, forSsl, forStartTlsOptional, forStartTlsRequired) that encode the security intent, with a private constructor that validates hostname (non-null, non-blank) and port (1-65535).",
