      "id": "claim_9c452471b54f466793bc701a21eb42bc",
      "statement": "EmailService manages a fixed-size ExecutorService thread pool that is created lazily on the first send() call, not in the constructor. The executor field is volatile and initialized via a synchronized getter.",
