    {
      "id": "claim_06e15641d6534d5fa8f971fe7bf98915",
      "statement": "SendEmailTask error handling contract: EmailException from email.send() or attachment/recipient operations is caught and its message added to the errors list; RuntimeException is caught as a top-level safety net with message prefixed 'Unexpected error: '; IllegalArgumentException from URI.create() is caught for malformed attachment URLs with the invalid URI included in the message; MalformedURLException is caught from URI.toURL(). Errors do not abort the task — attachment processing continues through remaining attachments.",
